00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:08.030
A 1697 broadway is either late Joe or maybe 1515.
百老汇1697号要么是《晚间秀》的地址，要么是1515号。

441
00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:10.590
Somewhere on broadway was the MTV headquarters and it was
MTV总部就在百老汇的某个地方，

442
00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:11.390
McCall's is right there.
McCall's就在那儿。

443
00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:15.310
We go there and one by one, we watch all those places become
我们去那儿，然后一个接一个地看着那些地方变成

444
00:19:15.310 --> 00:19:18.910
essentially Goliath National Bank or a pharmacy.
本质上是歌利亚国民银行或者药店。

445
00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:20.430
Like his winery hit or a rated.
就像他的酒庄或者其他什么。

446
00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:24.910
Well, it's also, I mean, this is getting into larger themes
嗯，这也是，我是说，这涉及到了这一集更大的主题，

447
00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.990
of this episode, which is like on its surface,
表面上看，

448
00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.910
the search for the best burger in New York.
是在寻找纽约最好吃的汉堡。

449
00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:33.550
But it's really a big question about time and how time changes us.
但实际上这是一个关于时间以及时间如何改变我们的大问题。

450
00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:36.110
How time changes the city, how time changes us.
时间如何改变城市，时间如何改变我们。

451
00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:39.710
And that opening montage of all those things changing.
还有那个关于所有事物变化的开场蒙太奇。

452
00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:43.870
And then you cut to Marshall giving himself pep talks in the mirror
然后镜头切到马歇尔在镜子前给自己打气，

453
00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.870
because he's going on this series of job interviews, right?
因为他要参加一系列的工作面试，对吧？

454
00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:46.590
Yeah, yeah.
对，对。

455
00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.510
And first one, he's cycling himself up.
第一次，他在给自己鼓劲。

456
00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:49.390
He's confident.
他很自信。

457
00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:52.030
The second one, he's less confident in the third one.
第二次，他没那么自信了，第三次。

458
00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:54.110
He says, you're not going to cry this time.
他说，这次你不能哭。

459
