1435
00:58:40.990 --> 00:58:43.950
We have to make sacrifices as we grow up.
我们在成长过程中必须做出牺牲。

1436
00:58:44.590 --> 00:58:47.470
There are limitations on our dreams
我们的梦想和理想主义

1437
00:58:47.470 --> 00:58:48.750
