因为否则悲伤就太沉重了。

1448
00:59:18.270 --> 00:59:20.030
Over and over and over,
一遍又一遍，

1449
00:59:20.030 --> 00:59:23.950
the hymnium theme is life is going to be hard.
这一集的主题是生活注定艰难。

1450
00:59:23.950 --> 00:59:27.070
There's going to be loss, grief and heartbreak.
总会有失去、悲伤和心碎。

1451
00:59:27.710 --> 00:59:28.830
In the end,
最终，

1452
00:59:28.830 --> 00:59:32.030
